    "preamble": "Sazid@Sabid vs State Of Rajasthan Through Pp on 23 November, 2017 Author: Sabina Bench: Sabina (1 of 2) In The High Court Of Judicature For Rajasthan Bench At Jaipur S.B. Criminal Miscellaneous Bail No. 16062/2017 Sazid @ Sabid S/o Shri Abdul Samad B/c Musalman, R/o Sanjay Colony, Muraina, Mp. (At Present Confined At District Jail, Dholpur). ----Petitioner Versus State of Rajasthan Through Pp ----Respondent",
    "facts": "Learned counsel for the petitioner has submitted that the petitioner is in custody since 5.11.2017. Name of the petitioner was disclosed by his co-accused Rambraj Singh. The said co-accused has been granted bail by Co-ordinate Bench of this court. Case of the petitioner is on a better footing than co-accused Rambraj Singh. Learned State Counsel on the other hand, has opposed the petition.",
